contentText:
When families think of CoComelon , they might instantly imagine an upbeat kids&#8217; song like &#8220;The Wheels on the Bus&#8221; &#8212; which has 9 billion-plus views and counting on YouTube. But for the preschool brand&#8217;s latest release, they&#8217;re slowing things down &#8212; way down &#8212; to help families with bedtime.

CoComelon&#8217;s new 30-track Nursery Rhyme Lullabies album takes some of the most recognizable kids&#8217; songs (yes, even &#8220;Wheels on the Bus&#8221;) and turns them into sleepy-time anthems &#8212; and Billboard Family is exclusively premiering a &#8220;peaceful&#8221; new spin on &#8220;The Farmer in the Dell&#8221; below.

